<title>USA: FSF Financial Corp Q1 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>FSF Financial Corp Q1 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996   1995</p>
<p> Total interest income				  6,564  5,488</p>
<p>Net interest income after provision</p>
<p>   for loan losses					2,648  2,263</p>
<p> Total non-interest income				338    305</p>
<p> Total non-interest expense			   1,774  1,846</p>
<p> Income before provision for income taxes	 1,212    722</p>
<p> Income tax expense					 490    301</p>
<p> Net income						   722    421</p>
<p> Earnings per share					0.24   0.11</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total assets as of December 31 were $362.37 million versus $354.64 million as of September 30.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
